    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5601" root="جرم" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَارِمٌ</span></b>  <i>Cutting off,</i> or <i>one who cuts off, the fruit
of the palm-tree:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرَّمٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُرَّامٌ</span>. (S.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِرْمَةٌ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَارِمُ أَهْلِهِ</span> (TA) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَهْلِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرِيمَةُ</span></b> 
(S, K *) <i>The gainer, acquirer,</i> or <i>earner,</i> [<i>of the
sustenance</i>] <i>of his family.</i> (S, K, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُجْرِمٌ</span>, in two places.

